      "title": "About world expansion",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "SplatTrajectoryEnricher is MUTED by default: it needs diffusers + the Flux fill weights (multi-GB) and a strong GPU.\n\nUnmute it to grow the static world beyond what the source video saw: for each pose along the novel path it renders the current splats, outpaints uncovered regions with Flux, lifts the filled view with SHARP, scale-aligns and smart-stitches the new content.\n\nTo use its result in the 4D scene, rewire BuildSplats4D.static from SplatPolish's output to enriched_splats."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
